          "label": "高阶极点留数计算",
          "steps": [
            "$z=1$ 是三阶极点。",
            "",
            "使用三阶极点的留数公式：",
            "$$\\text{Res}(f, 1) = \\frac{1}{(3-1)!}\\lim_{z \\to 1}\\frac{d^2}{dz^2}[(z-1)^3 \\cdot \\frac{z^2}{(z-1)^3}]$$",
            "",
            "$$= \\frac{1}{2}\\lim_{z \\to 1}\\frac{d^2}{dz^2}(z^2) = \\frac{1}{2}\\lim_{z \\to 1}\\frac{d}{dz}(2z) = \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 2 = 1$$",
