      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "用 Weierstrass 代换 $z = e^{i\\theta}$ 转化为复积分",
        "确定奇点",
        "计算留数",
        "应用留数定理"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "trigonometric_integral",
        "template": "用留数定理计算三角函数的定积分",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 12,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "Weierstrass代换与复积分",
          "steps": [
            "令 $z = e^{i\\theta}$，则 $\\cos\\theta = \\frac{z + z^{-1}}{2}$，$d\\theta = \\frac{dz}{iz}$，积分路径为 $|z|=1$。",
            "",
            "$$\\int_0^{2\\pi} \\frac{1}{5-3\\cos\\theta}d\\theta = \\oint_{|z|=1} \\frac{1}{5-3 \\cdot \\frac{z+z^{-1}}{2}} \\cdot \\frac{dz}{iz}$$",
            "",
            "$$= \\oint_{|z|=1} \\frac{1}{5-\\frac{3z+3/z}{2}} \\cdot \\frac{dz}{iz} = \\oint_{|z|=1} \\frac{1}{\\frac{10-3z-3/z}{2}} \\cdot \\frac{dz}{iz}$$",
            "",
            "$$= \\oint_{|z|=1} \\frac{2}{10-3z-3/z} \\cdot \\frac{dz}{iz} = \\oint_{|z|=1} \\frac{2z}{iz(10-3z-3/z)} \\, dz$$",
            "",
            "$$= \\oint_{|z|=1} \\frac{2z}{iz(10-3z-3/z)} \\, dz = \\oint_{|z|=1} \\frac{2}{i(10-3z-3/z)} \\, dz$$",
            "",
            "分母化简：$10 - 3z - \\frac{3}{z} = \\frac{10z - 3z^2 - 3}{z} = \\frac{-3z^2 + 10z - 3}{z}$",
            "",
            "$$= \\oint_{|z|=1} \\frac{2z}{i(-3z^2 + 10z - 3)} \\, dz = \\oint_{|z|=1} \\frac{-2z}{i(3z^2 - 10z + 3)} \\, dz$$"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "求解奇点",
          "steps": [
            "分母 $3z^2 - 10z + 3 = 0$ 的根为：",
            "$$z = \\frac{10 \\pm \\sqrt{100-36}}{6} = \\frac{10 \\pm 8}{6}$$",
            "",
            "$$z_1 = 3, \\quad z_2 = \\frac{1}{3}$$",
            "",
            "在 $|z|=1$ 内只有奇点 $z = \\frac{1}{3}$（一阶极点）。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "计算留数",
          "steps": [
            "$$\\text{Res}\\left(\\frac{-2z}{i(3z^2-10z+3)}, \\frac{1}{3}\\right) = \\lim_{z \\to 1/3}\\left(z-\\frac{1}{3}\\right) \\cdot \\frac{-2z}{i(3z^2-10z+3)}$$",
            "",
            "分母因式分解：$3z^2 - 10z + 3 = 3(z-3)(z-1/3)$",
            "",
            "$$= \\lim_{z \\to 1/3}\\frac{-2z}{i \\cdot 3(z-3)} = \\frac{-2 \\cdot 1/3}{i \\cdot 3 \\cdot (1/3 - 3)} = \\frac{-2/3}{i \\cdot 3 \\cdot (-8/3)}$$",
            "",
            "$$= \\frac{-2/3}{-8i} = \\frac{2/3}{8i} = \\frac{1}{12i}$$"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "最终结果",
          "steps": [
            "由留数定理：",
            "$$\\int_0^{2\\pi} \\frac{1}{5-3\\cos\\theta}d\\theta = 2\\pi i \\cdot \\frac{1}{12i} = 2\\pi \\cdot \\frac{1}{12} = \\frac{\\pi}{6}$$"
          ]
        }
      ],
